Soul Searching - Soulbound Tokens presented by Binance Research

- SBTs offer a publicly visible, non-transferable token to foster a decentralized society;
- The Binance Account Bound (BAB) token represents the credentials of Binance Know-Your-Client (KYC) users;
- The use cases for SBTs are wide-ranging, complementing the current NFT landscape.

Deep dive into Soulbound Tokens here👉  https://research.binance.com/en/analysis/soul-searching

[Layer 2 Scaling - Market Update] presented by Binance Research

- Dive deep into the space and look at the different characteristics of Layer 2 scaling solutions, including Side Chains;
- zkEVM and zk-Rollups are the most competitive in terms of technical solution;
- zk-Rollups offer the best overall approach in terms of security, performance, usability, and other noteworthy aspects;
- There is a place for optimistic rollups in the forseeable future until zkEVM becomes strong enough;
- A closer look at Arbitrum. As of now, the majority of applications on Ethereum will likely move to Layer Arbitrum. We expect more bridges between L2s and centralized exchanges, as well as bridges between various L2s.

Read more👉  https://research.binance.com/en/analysis/layer-2-scaling
